; The CSV writes a number with the decimal mark of the commodity (comma for EUR here, from the
; directive) and no digit groups; the JSON is the same number.
commodity 1.000,00 EUR
commodity $1,000.00
P 2026-01-01 X 3 EUR

2026-01-01 comma decimals
    a      7.900,00 EUR
    b      1.234.567,89 EUR
    c      5 X
    d      $1,234,567.89
    sink
